MainChick keeps an eye on barn conditions 24/7 and flags potential health
issues before they become outbreaks.

## The problem

In poultry farming, small environmental drifts and early infections are easy to
miss and expensive to catch late. Farmers needed a way to see trouble coming.

## What we built

A sensor-fed monitoring system tracking temperature, humidity, and other barn
conditions, paired with an ML layer that spots early warning signs. An AI
chatbot answers day-to-day poultry questions — trained well enough to be
genuinely useful, not a gimmick.

## Results

The system reached the finals of both the Google Solution Challenge and the
International Imagine Cup, and placed top two at Astranauts 2023.
